# Judge10-24-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

; ＠備考◆ずっと冷静

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR12,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:小时候<br>我曾长期遭受<br>他人对我的肉体伤害。|#0205Trial24_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:虽然我还小，<br>但是后来的某天<br>我试着反抗了一下。|#0205Trial24_Sherry002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR7,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Flushed_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Cry_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……不过<br>我好像力气<br>比别人稍微<br>大了一点。|#0205Trial24_Sherry003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR10,ArmL9,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Wink_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:结果就是，<br>这个世界上<br>又少了<br>一条生命。|#0205Trial24_Sherry004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:案子最终成了无头迷案，<br>而设施职员惨死的尸体，<br>也被当成意外死亡处理，<br>一切都埋葬在了黑暗中。|#0205Trial24_Sherry005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; ＠備考◆絵本を読むように/笑顔

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:不过之后<br>雪莉她<br>被新的家庭<br>收养了。|#0205Trial24_Sherry006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:就这样<br>在温柔的<br>养父养母身边，<br>雪莉从此<br>过上了<br>幸福快乐的生活。<br>可喜可贺，可喜可贺——|#0205Trial24_Sherry007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; ＠備考◆真顔／シリアスにやや低めに・大人っぽく

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL14,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:——假如真是那样<br>就好了。|#0205Trial24_Sherry008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR13,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:只是雪莉她<br>从那以后好像<br>变成了跟其他人<br>稍微不太一样的<br>生物。|#0205Trial24_Sherry009| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL14,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我对养父养母<br>没有任何不满。<br>所以我<br>打算努力成为<br>他们所期望的<br>【好孩子】。|#0205Trial24_Sherry010| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL14,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我对身边的人<br>也一样。<br>……虽然不太懂，<br>但也在努力融入其中哦。|#0205Trial24_Sherry011| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR7,ArmL14,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Flushed_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"只不过……<br>我好像<link=\"Objection_02_05_24_01\">真的做不到</link>呢。<br>|#0205Trial24_Sherry012|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; ＠備考◆大げさな演技・わざとらしい泣き真似

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR10,ArmL11,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Cry_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:不管怎么努力<br>也无法假装成<br>普通人……<br>这不是<br>很可悲吗？<br>嘤嘤嘤嘤……！|#0205Trial24_Sherry013| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

; ＠備考◆冷静

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"……【悲伤】是<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_24_02\">这样表达</link>的，没错吧？|#0205Trial24_Sherry014|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4


